      "widgets_values": [
        "## Demucs v4 6-stem separation\n\nSplits a song into vocals, drums, bass, other, guitar and piano with `htdemucs_6s`, plus an instrumental mix (everything except vocals).\n\nSwitch the model to `htdemucs` / `htdemucs_ft` for the classic 4 stems (guitar and piano outputs are then empty: turn them off).\n\nWeights (MIT) auto-download to `models/demucs/`. Roughly 4 GB VRAM; set device to cpu if needed."
      ],
